Migration commands for this branch:

    flask --app app db upgrade head
    flask --app app db downgrade base

Review the target DATABASE_URL before running either command. Upgrade head
preserves the legacy JSON column while copying its content into relational
tables and adds a gradebook concurrency version. Downgrade base removes the
relational tables and added version column while leaving the legacy JSON in
place; application writes keep it synchronized during the compatibility window.
